WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Playing cards spends elixir while timed attacks continue.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Damage and temporary effects change the battle state.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.170
The last enemy takes damage as attacks and cards continue.

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:45.800
Victory presents three reward cards; this run selects Radiant Ward.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.890
The reward joins the deck on the map.
